urt out all the stupid [ __ ] but  I've heard the weirdest stuff when it  comes to trying to conceive like oh you  gotta do it every day oh just do it  every day okay that's fine if you're  trying for like two weeks but have you  tried doing it every day for a [ __ ]  year do you know how sore you would be  [Music]  that's just not possible the best piece  of advice is when you stop trying is  when it's gonna happen like what do you  mean by stop trying you mean when you  stop having  I don't know if you didn't take human  development in school or you can't just  stop having sex and then magically get  pregnant it's not how it works and I'm  realizing that I'm a total hypocrite  like making a whole video giving advice  I'm just trying to help you through it  as a person who's been through it I'm  just trying to create a safe space for  it when you look into your child dies  you're not going to remember like the  sticks you peed on or the blood tests  you took or the doctor's visits you had  to do and like whatever process it took  whether it was conceiving or IVF or  adoption none of that matters and  however it happens I hope it does happen  for you and what it does it's gonna be  everything so to all of you out there  who are trying may your conception be  fruitful like this wine of grapes that's  like I got for today I'm Hannah your  friendly neighborhood wine mom and if  there's a topic you want me to talk  about in a future episode or any  experience you have with trying to  conceive leave it in the comments or you  can always text me I don't always  respond but I read every single one I  love to hear what you guys want me to  talk about and I love hearing your  personal stories and in the meantime I'm  gonna go on Facebook and look at all my  friends pictures of their newborns to  feel my baby fever till next time oh my  god there's old  oh my god

